{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">消息指新皇崗口岸最快下周一清早啟用，周日會有開通儀式，有的士業界指收到通知早上六時半到新口岸載客。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">廣東省委書記黃坤明到深圳市調研皇崗口岸樞紐，實地察看口岸功能、通關查驗流程等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199292-%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E5%93%AA%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E9%85%8D%E5%A5%97%E5%8D%B3%E7%9D%87%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A9%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E5%85%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">投票｜新皇崗口岸開通在即，你最關注哪方面配套？｜即睇皇崗口岸自助通道全流程</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T10:58:40.673364+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}